  <article class="tp-article">

  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> the five zones are 50&ndash;60%, 60&ndash;70%, 70&ndash;80%, 80&ndash;90% and 90&ndash;100% of your heart rate range. With the Karvonen method, zone heart rate = resting HR + (max HR &minus; resting HR) &times; intensity. <strong>Zone 2</strong> is 60&ndash;70%.</p></div>

